# Rust build artefacts under native/<crate>/target — committed
# .so files in priv/ are the released artifact; the target/ dirs
# are intermediate output from `cargo build --release` and not
# worth committing.
native/*/target/

# ex_doc generated output. Source of truth lives in assets/, guides/, and
# inline @doc/@spec annotations. doc/ is regenerated by `rebar3 ex_doc`
# and published to hexdocs.pm via `rebar3 hex publish`.
doc/
